  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "🩵Introducing ~ Blue Crab Retreat<br>2 Resort Pools | 6-Seater Golf Cart | Bikes | Sleeps 18<br><br>Pinching to getaway? Blue Crab Retreat is the place to stay! This 5-bedroom, 3.5 bath home sleeps 18 (yes, 18!!) and is perfectly located in the south side of Prominence on 30A, steps away from pool time and The Big Chill. This home comes with 2 King ensuites, 2 bunkrooms, spacious entertainment spaces, a grill, and a smoker. With 4 bikes and a 6-seater golf cart, getting around 30A is a breeze! <br><br>Highlights<br>- 6-seater golf cart<br>- 4 adult bikes<br>- Corn hole<br>- Access to 2 community resort-style pools. Steps from the South side pool!<br>- Large community grill and dining area on the North side<br>- Close to The Big Chill<br>- Easy Beach Access<br>- Complimentary Beach Gear: Beach towels, 4 beach chairs, and an umbrella.<br><br>🏡Welcome to the Neighborhood!<br>- The Prominence community is a gem! You're steps away from everything at The Big Chill. This includes restaurants, shops, and an amphitheater that has a covered event pavilion. It also has a great cinema screen for movies as well as a stage for concerts and events! Watch a game on the big screen or enjoy a family “screen on the green” movie night. There is entertainment most nights during the season. Several delights await you! Terrific BBQ, tacos, spirits, ice cream along with unique one-of-a-kind eateries to explore during your stay. <br>- There are an endless amount of great restaurants to choose from. Black Bear Bread Co in Grayton Beach or a lazy Saturday morning at Great Southern Cafe in Seaside are our personal favorites. Pecan Jacks for ice cream also can't be missed!!<br><br>🏖️Let's go to the Beach! <br>Prominence has a lot of options for beach access; some of our favorites are listed below. <br>- Deer Lake State Park Beach Access: (2 min drive, 5 min golf cart), 15 min walk Closest to Prominence and most convenient. This access point also features parking, restrooms, dining pavilions with charcoal grills. <br>- Gulf Lakes Beach Access / Seabreeze Beach Access: (7 min by bike) Best for bike rides to the beach east on the pedestrian path on the South side of 30A. No parking here- shower and bike rack available here. <br>- Walton Dunes Beach Access: (10 min. golf cart ride) West on 30A from Prominence. One of our favorites! The access point features roadside parking and bike racks. Great for dropping off passengers and your gear before parking in the nearby lot. <br>- Inlet Beach Regional Access: (15 min by car) Plenty of amenities! Features: ample parking, on-duty Lifeguards, and restrooms. You cannot take the golf cart to the Inlet Beach Access due to the distance from the house and because carts are restricted in Alys Beach, Rosemary Beach, and along Highway 98. <br><br>🦀Crab Walk Inside ~ <br>FIRST FLOOR<br>- Step up onto the front porch and take in the beach vibes on the rockers.<br>- Come on in, huge open concept living and dining area will greet you! This space is ideal for a large gathering space for your entire crew. <br>- The spacious, fully stocked kitchen is fully equipped to whip a meal or enjoy takeout with the fam! You'll also enjoy island seating for 6, or the spacious dining table for 8. A true treat! <br>- With 3 comfortable loveseats, the living room invites everyone to gather and relax. From cozy movie nights or slow easy mornings, this is the space where memories are made.<br>- Need some fresh air? Step outside onto the back patio that features comfortable seating, a grill, and a smoker for the ultimate BBQ!<br>- Rounding out the floor is a half bathroom tucked away off the kitchen. <br><br>SECOND FLOOR<br>- Make your way upstairs, all the bedrooms await! <br>- Up first is a spacious King bedroom with a large walk-in closet and shared hall bathroom. <br>- This home also comes with 2 bunk rooms! The first bunk room features a Twin over Double bunk plus a Twin trundle with a walk-in closet, and the second bunk room features 2 Twin over Double bunks.<br>- Further down the hall is a King guest bedroom featuring a walk-in closet and an ensuite with a walk-in shower.<br>- The spacious Primary King bedroom features a work desk, large walk-in closet, and a private balcony. The spa-like primary ensuite features dual sinks, a walk-in shower, and a soaking tub. <br><br>💤For Rest ~ All bedrooms are located on the second floor! <br>- Primary Bedroom ~ King bed with private ensuite<br>- King bedroom with private ensuite<br>- King bedroom<br>- Twin over Double bunkroom with Twin trundle<br>- 2 Twin over Double bunkroom, plus 2 Twin trundles<br>- We've got your little one covered - we provide a pack n play as well. <br><br>🌟Essentials ~ We got you covered!<br>- We provide a starter kit of everything you'll need to kick off your stay: paper towels, toilet paper, dish soap, laundry pods, and more.<br>- Kitchen essentials like olive oil, salt, and pepper, and basic cooking staples provided <br>- The home has both a Keurig and a standard drip coffee maker! Bonus: coffee's on us!<br>- Premium full-size bath products in every bathroom/kitchen – We provide body wash, shampoo, conditioner, lotion, and hand soap.<br>- Complimentary Beach Gear: Beach towels, 4 beach chairs, and an umbrella.<br><br>✏️Other Things to Note<br>- Parking is available in the driveway for 4 vehicles total. Additional parking located in the gravel spaces around the community.<br>- Minimum age to rent the home is 25.<br>- We love our furry friends, and they need a vacation too! A one-time, non-refundable pet fee of $150 will be added to your reservation. Thank you for understanding!<br>- Vacation disruptions can be a bummer. While it doesn't happen often, you may experience issues with Wi-Fi or construction on 30A. We are not responsible for any disruptions to the Wi-Fi service or any construction that may affect your experience. Please note that such occurrences are beyond our control, and we appreciate your understanding and patience in these matters.<br><br>This home is proudly managed by Kalos Dwellings. Please reach out if we can answer any questions for you! 💛",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "🌊 2 Resort Pools | Corn Hole | 6-Seater Golf Cart | Bikes | Sleeps 18!"
        }
      ],
